----------+-------------+---------------
index     |__uniq__L.s  |               
index     |l_s2         |               
index     |l_s3         |               
index     |l_s_btree_num|               
constraint|c_nn         |NOT NULL (:L).s
constraint|c_u          |UNIQUE (:L).s  
